msgstr "Account Task Selection"

msgid "状态"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "跳剧情"
msgstr "Skip Dialog"

msgid "跳过剧情触发式任务：自动点击跳过对话框和确认按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Skip dialog trigger task: automatically click skip dialog and confirm "
"buttons."

msgid "辅助星结"
msgstr "Star Link Assist"

msgid "星结辅助触发式任务：缔结星结时，光标指向目标出现可射击光圈，自动点击屏幕准心完成射击。"
msgstr ""
"Star Link assist trigger task: while bonding a Star Link, automatically "
"clicks the screen crosshair to fire when the shootable ring appears over the"
" target."

msgid "宝箱开锁"
msgstr "Treasure Unlock"

msgid "进入开锁界面后启动任务，自动校准颜色条带并开锁。"
msgstr ""
"Start the task on the lock screen to calibrate the color bands and unlock "
"the chest."

msgid "家园每日"
msgstr "Home Daily"

msgid "完成家园每日任务"
msgstr "Complete home daily tasks"

msgid "执行家园每日：收菜、做饭、喂饭"
msgstr "Run home daily: harvest crops, cook, and feed"

#: src/tasks/onetime/auto_jenga_task.py
msgid "自动祖赞卡之梯"
msgstr "Auto Zuzanka’s Ladder"

#: src/tasks/onetime/auto_jenga_task.py
msgid "进入祖赞卡之梯后启动任务，自动放置图腾。"
msgstr "Start the task in Zuzanka’s Ladder to place totems automatically."

#: src/tasks/onetime/auto_jenga_task.py
msgid "正在对准图腾"
msgstr "Aligning the totem"

#: src/tasks/onetime/auto_jenga_task.py
msgid "祖赞卡之梯辅助已停止"
msgstr "Zuzanka’s Ladder assistance stopped"

msgid "每日收菜"
msgstr "Daily Claim"

msgid "执行每日收菜：邮件、惊喜盒子、日常/周常活跃、大月卡"
msgstr ""
"Run daily claim: mail, surprise box, daily/weekly activity, monthly card"

msgid "委托每日"
msgstr "Commission Daily"

msgid "执行委托每日：消耗体力刷选定的每日委托（需先解锁自动战斗）"
msgstr ""
"Run commission daily: spend power to farm the selected daily commission "
"(auto-combat must be unlocked first)"

msgid "进入音游后启动任务，自动演奏当前曲目。"
msgstr ""
"Start the task in the rhythm game to play the current song automatically."

msgid "任务队列"
msgstr "Task queue"

msgid "队列空闲"
msgstr "Queue idle"

msgid "项"
msgstr "items"

msgid "合计"
msgstr "Total"

msgid "队列悬浮窗"
msgstr "Queue overlay"

msgid "位置与大小"
msgstr "Position & size"

msgid "当前状态"
msgstr "Current state"

msgid "选择图标"
msgstr "Choose icon"

msgid "悬停窗口可以拖动，拖右下角改大小，松手自动保存。"
msgstr ""
"Drag the window to move it, drag the bottom-right corner to resize; changes "
"are saved automatically."

msgid "保存并应用"
msgstr "Save and apply"

msgid "恢复默认位置与大小"
msgstr "Reset position and size"

msgid "选择图标文件"
msgstr "Choose an icon file"

msgid "游戏在前台，已隐藏"
msgstr "Hidden (game in the foreground)"

msgid "已恢复默认位置与大小"
msgstr "Position and size reset"

msgid "启用队列悬浮窗"
msgstr "Enable the queue overlay"

msgid "游戏在后台时显示（游戏在前台时永远不显示）"
msgstr "Show while the game is in the background (never in the foreground)"

msgid "显示正在执行和排队中的任务；每项耗时取最近 5 次实际用时的平均值。"
msgstr ""
"Shows the running and queued tasks; each estimate averages the last 5 actual"
" runs."

msgid "不透明度"
msgstr "Opacity"

msgid "图标"
msgstr "Icon"

msgid "图标大小"
msgstr "Icon size"

msgid "左键单击图标展开队列，双击面板收回图标。"
msgstr ""
"Left-click the icon to open the queue; double-click the panel to go back to "
"the icon."

msgid "图标会一直留在任务栏上方，不会被任务栏盖住。"
msgstr "The icon always stays above the taskbar and is never covered by it."

msgid "宽度"
msgstr "Width"

msgid "高度"
msgstr "Height"

msgid "圆角"
msgstr "Corner radius"

msgid "最多显示"
msgstr "Show at most"

msgid "队列里的耗时来自历史记录：每个任务保留最近 5 次，不足 5 次按已有次数平均。"
msgstr ""
"Estimates come from history: each task keeps its last 5 runs; fewer runs are"
" averaged as-is."

msgid "悬浮窗尚未创建"
msgstr "The overlay has not been created yet"

msgid "显示中"
msgstr "Showing"

msgid "未显示"
msgstr "Hidden"

msgid "已保存队列悬浮窗设置"
msgstr "Queue overlay settings saved"

msgid "已保存；重启程序后生效"
msgstr "Saved; takes effect after a restart"

